  "notes": "COMMON COMPOUNDS:\n- {代理人|だいりにん} (agent, proxy, representative)\n- {代理店|だいりてん} (agency, dealership)\n- {代理出産|だいりしゅっさん} (surrogate birth)\n- {代理母|だいりはは} (surrogate mother)\n\nGRAMMAR:\n- 〜の{代理|だいり}で: on behalf of ~, in place of ~\n- {代理|だいり}を{務|つと}める: to serve as a substitute\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {代理|だいり}: Proxy, acting on behalf (formal delegation)\n- {代|か}わり: Substitute, replacement (more casual)",
